{"text":"And when they're done with their run, they feel fantastic. And then an hour later, they're in pain. For damage, they caused their muscles an hour before. This is what endorphins are designed to do. They're designed to mask physical pain. The caveman reason for this stuff, because this stuff was all from 50,000 years ago, understand homo sapien existed at the same time as other hominid species, and yet we survived and they didn't. What is it about this species that's so good at survival and thriving? Look at the world we've built. It's not just that we're smart. We're certainly not the strongest and we're certainly not the smartest. It's that we're social animals. We have to do things together. We have to look after each other and we have to work together to ensure that we survive, that we do well. This is how we're designed, right? These chemicals are trying to make that happen. So in these caveman times, 50,000 years ago, Paleolithic era,","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.5},{"text":"when","start":0.5,"end":0.62},{"text":"they're","start":0.62,"end":0.84},{"text":"done","start":0.84,"end":1.0},{"text":"with","start":1.0,"end":1.18},{"text":"their","start":1.18,"end":1.36},{"text":"run","start":1.36,"end":1.56,"punct":","},{"text":"they","start":1.74,"end":1.84},{"text":"feel","start":1.84,"end":2.22},{"text":"fantastic","start":2.22,"end":3.18,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":4.22,"end":4.3},{"text":"then","start":4.3,"end":4.4},{"text":"an","start":4.4,"end":4.52},{"text":"hour","start":4.52,"end":4.72},{"text":"later","start":4.72,"end":5.02,"punct":","},{"text":"they're","start":5.02,"end":5.24},{"text":"in","start":5.24,"end":5.36},{"text":"pain","start":5.36,"end":5.74,"punct":"."},{"text":"For","start":6.18,"end":6.44},{"text":"damage","start":6.44,"end":6.74,"punct":","},{"text":"they","start":6.86,"end":6.94},{"text":"caused","start":6.94,"end":7.14},{"text":"their","start":7.14,"end":7.36},{"text":"muscles","start":7.36,"end":7.56},{"t